WEBVTT

00:10:57.319 --> 00:11:01.198
When a student uses the chop saw
for the very first time,

00:11:01.198 --> 00:11:04.535
I'm standing right next to them
saying, "You got this."

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:09.039
And these are the things
that make the difference.

00:11:09.581 --> 00:11:14.128
And so the next generation
of tradeswomen, our students,

00:11:14.169 --> 00:11:15.671
will enter the trades

00:11:15.713 --> 00:11:19.299
knowing what it feels like
to be respected and valued

00:11:19.341 --> 00:11:21.635
and will know how to demand it
when they're not.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:27.766
(Applause)

00:11:28.016 --> 00:11:32.312
I may not have had a female mentor
on my first construction site,